OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared amid
OL,4,Ahigh demand in A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has declared a critical
OL,7,Fincident due to "severe and sustained
OL,8,Fpressure" on its services.
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals Coventry and
OL,11,FWarwickshire (UHCW) NHS Trust declared
OL,12,Fthe incident on Monday after
OL,13,F"exceptionally high demand" for
OL,14,Femergency care.
OL,16,FGabrielle Harris, chief operating
OL,17,Fofficer, said teams at the hospital
OL,18,Fwere "doing everything they can" but
OL,19,F"the level of demand is placing
OL,20,Fconsiderable strain on services".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
