OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared amid
OL,4,Ahigh demand in A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The decision to declare a critical
OL,7,Fincident reflects the seriousness of
OL,8,Fthe situation and the steps we need to
OL,9,Ftake to maintain safe care for our
OL,10,Fpatients," she added.
